<title>JAPAN: Tokyo oil products market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo oil products market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo oil products market is closed for a national holiday on Wednesday. Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, naphtha prices fell in reaction to sharp falls in overnight crude prices.</p>
<p>Open-spec naphtha for first-half March was quoted at $242.50/243.50, down from late Monday's $248.50/249.50.</p>
</text>
